{"date":"2026-11-15","caps":[[0.05,"Arnie Jordan here, coming to you from row three at Jordan Arena, with the Rinkside Report."],[5.14,"And this week, for the first time ever, you can see me! That's right, the Rinkside Report is on camera."],[10.96,"The camera is my nephew's iPad, propped up on my coffee cup and held there with a roll of hockey tape."],[16.72,"It took him forty minutes to find me the record button. So wave. Two of you, maybe three. Hi."],[22.61,"Sunday, November fifteenth."],[24.16,"Last week my nephew said we try crayons, so I came with the notebook and the big box. Sixty-four colours!"],[30.02,"Thirty-seven goals. You'd think that's plenty. You would be wrong."],[34.34,"The early game, the J.E. Culp Habs against the Timbit Senators."],[37.84,"Dixon opened it, Williams tied it, and Tuby put the Habs back up."],[41.44,"Then, with two seconds left in the first, Greg Penney scored all by himself. Two seconds."],[46.36,"That's not a goal, that's a doorbell ditch."],[49.4,"Then the Habs hit the buffet. KP, thirty-six seconds into the second. Holt got one back. Cooke. Deakin."],[55.07,"Then Greg Penney, Tuby and Dixon, three goals in three minutes, and Chinner made it nine to three."],[60.46,"By then I'd used red, blue, white, a second red, and Burnt Sienna. I don't know what Burnt Sienna is."],[66.02,"Buynink came out of the Senators net for Shannon halfway through, and the Habs said welcome, here's six more."],[72.67,"In the third, Williams and Simon Murphy made it nine to six. Then Hunt, and Ort. Eleven to six, final."],[78.29,"Tuby had five points."],[79.49,"And Ort scored, set one up, and took three for roughing at the exact same second Schmidt took three for slashing."],[85.72,"Those two weren't battling, they were synchronizing watches."],[89.69,"Game two, The Keg Canucks against Dawson's Oilers. Adam Short and Beckett put the Canucks up two nothing."],[95.58,"Then the second period became the McPherson Show. McPherson from Mansion."],[99.69,"McPherson again, tie game, and on that same second both teams changed goalies."],[104.73,"Snihur went off for tripping, and the Canucks scored anyway. Koke, short-handed, from Pundy and Goodie."],[110.28,"McPherson got it back on the power play, three all. Then the Oilers got caught with too many men."],[115.51,"NoPants hopped over the boards, Wall never came off, and HoundDog got to sit three minutes for the both of them."],[121.54,"NoPants, Wall, it's a line change, not a carpool."],[124.21,"Colin Murphy scored right after it ran out, from Adam Short and Wes Short."],[128.22,"The Short to Short connection now comes with a Murphy extension."],[132.34,"McPherson tied it four all in the third. Four goals, every Oiler goal, and Mansion helped on all four."],[137.83,"That's not a line, that's a two-man band. Then New Guy scored, and a minute later New Guy scored again."],[143.38,"Six to four Canucks, and that's the Canucks' first win of the season! Somebody frame the score sheet."],[148.82,"McPherson, four goals and a loss. That's catching four fish and the boat sinks."],[153.08,"And Dawson gave up four in front of a team named after him. Nobody respects the landlord."],[158.49,"The late game, the ColdBreak Leafs against the RegattaSport Nordiques. Pierce scored twenty-seven seconds in."],[164.3,"Brophy went off for hooking, and Lawrence scored short-handed anyway. Two short-handed goals in one night."],[169.96,"I don't own a crayon for that. Then Pierce got the power-play goal, from Steele. Two to one Leafs."],[175.82,"In the second, Collini went off for slashing, and the Nordiques made it count."],[180.27,"Rob DeBolster scored while he sat, and thirty-five seconds later Dykstra, three to two Nordiques."],[185.8,"Collini, one slash, two goals against. Bad exchange rate."],[189.07,"Mallet came out for Rosie, JMAC came out for Trigg, and Pulo made it four to two with fifty-eight seconds left in the period."],[196.84,"Langlois scored early in the third. Larry Penney got one back."],[200.16,"Then Moorzey scored from Regular and Lawrence, and on that same second, Brophy went off for roughing."],[205.55,"Brophy, up by three and you still needed a sit-down. Six minutes, most of anybody all night."],[210.46,"Horton got one more for the Leafs, and that was it. Six to four Nordiques."],[215.04,"Somewhere in there, a clearing attempt went so high it rang off the clock."],[218.84,"I didn't catch who shot it, and I'm not asking."],[221.93,"Now, a look at the big board, seven games in."],[224.59,"The scoring race: McPherson leads with nineteen points, and right behind him, KP, Pierce and Moorzey are all tied at eighteen."],[231.94,"Three fellas at eighteen. That's not a race, that's a traffic jam."],[235.82,"In net, by goals against average, Trigg is on top at three twenty-two, JMAC is right behind him at three thirty-eight, and Dawson is third at three forty-two."],[245.02,"The Nordiques' top two goalies share one crease, and they just swapped spots. Cozy."],[250.51,"And the standings."],[251.54,"The Nordiques are seven and oh, fourteen points, perfect, and I'm running out of nice things to say."],[256.99,"The Oilers are second with nine."],[258.78,"The Habs and Leafs are tied with seven, the Senators have six, and the Canucks have two, both from last night."],[264.77,"You've got to start somewhere, boys."],[267.4,"So that's your week."],[268.56,"Eleven for the Habs, four for McPherson in a loss, and a New Guy who scored two and is still the New Guy."],[274.41,"By the late game I was writing Nordiques goals in Mauve. My nephew says next week, a whiteboard."],[279.77,"If I got your name wrong, or gave your goal to the fella beside you, take it up with the refs, the timekeeper, and how fast you guys skate out there."],[288.05,"Tape your sticks. This has been Arnie Jordan with the Rinkside Report."]],"pages":[["ROW 3 - 11/15","ON CAMERA!!","iPad + hockey tape","coffee = tripod"],["64 crayons","nephew: trust me","37 goals??"],["G1: Habs @ Sens","Habs 3 - Sens 1","Culp: 2 assists","Dixon 2G 2A!!","Williams 2G 2A!!"],["HABS 9 SENS 3","used: red, blue,","white, red again,","BURNT SIENNA??"],["Habs 11 - Sens 6  FINAL","Williams 2G 2A!!","Murphy 1G","Hunt 1G 1A","Ort 1G 1A"],["G2: Canucks @ Oilers","Canucks 2 - Oilers 2","Dawson: in, then out","Short 1G 1A","Beckett 1G 1A"],["!NoPants: on","!Wall: never off","!HoundDog: sits","line chg, not carpool"],["CANUCKS 6 OIL 4","McPherson: 4 G","Mansion: 4 A","CANUCKS 1st WIN!"],["G3: Leafs @ Nordiques","Leafs 2 - Nordiques 1","Pierce 2G 1A!!","!Brophy: hooking +1 more","Lawrence 1G 1A"],["NORDS 3 LEAFS 2","!Collini - slash","= 2 goals agst","bad exch. rate"],["Leafs 4 - Nordiques 6","Langlois 1G","Penney 1G","Moorzey 1G 1A","Regular: 1 assist"],["Leafs 4 - Nordiques 6  FINAL","stretch legs","where'd the puck go"],["McPherson 19","KP/Pierce/Moorzey 18","= traffic jam","Trigg 3.22 JMAC 3.38"],["NORDS 7-0 14 pts","OIL 9 HABS 7","LEAFS 7 SENS 6","CANUCKS 2 (new!)"],["crayons: 0 left","Nords in MAUVE","next wk: whiteboard"]],"sleeper":{"team":"SEN","seed":5657},"kf":[{"t":34.34,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":1200,"h":0,"a":0,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":37.84,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":825,"h":0,"a":1,"goal":"DIXON","final":false},{"t":38.77,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":665,"h":1,"a":1,"goal":"WILLIAMS","final":false},{"t":39.97,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":464,"h":1,"a":2,"goal":"TUBY","final":false},{"t":44.01,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":2,"h":1,"a":3,"goal":"PENNEY","final":false},{"t":44.38,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":0,"h":1,"a":3,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":44.4,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":1200,"h":1,"a":3,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":51.03,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":1164,"h":1,"a":4,"goal":"KP","final":false},{"t":53.21,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":928,"h":2,"a":4,"goal":"HOLT","final":false},{"t":54.25,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":834,"h":2,"a":5,"goal":"COOKE","final":false},{"t":54.63,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":615,"h":3,"a":5,"goal":"DEAKIN","final":false},{"t":55.61,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":453,"h":3,"a":6,"goal":"PENNEY","fina